▪ Reference-Word

▪▪ Description

A ❲Context❳❪600034.md❫ always exists semantically. It can provide a ❲Binding❳❪60050.md❫, that allows a ❲Reference-Word❳❪600010.md❫ Occurrence to resolve its referenced ❲Thing❳❪60003.md❫.

The Binding can be implicit in the surface Text and supplied by the containing Blog, Document, Quote or Session.

For example, a Blog can establish its Author as the Speaker of the following Text:

◦ Nachdem ❲❛mir❜❳❪600010.md❫ die logische Unvereinbarkeit des dritten Gutachtens mit der Empfehlung von Herrn W. etwas Kopfzerbrechen bereitet hat ...

The Context-Binding can also be introduced explicitly before the Reference:

◦ Hier spricht ❲❛Michael❜❳❪0.md❫ - Nachdem ❲❛mir❜❳❪600010.md❫ die logische Unvereinbarkeit ...

▪▪ Examples

▪▪▪ Personal-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Subject-Anaphora

◦ DEU: Michael arbeitet. ❲❛Er❜❳❪600010.md❫ singt.
◦ ENG: Michael works. ❲❛He❜❳❪600010.md❫ sings.
◦ LAT: Michael laborat. ❲❛Is❜❳❪600010.md❫ cantat.

▪▪▪▪ Object-Anaphora

◦ DEU: Anna sieht Michael. Sie grüßt ❲❛ihn❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ ENG: Anna sees Michael. She greets ❲❛him❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ LAT: Anna Michaelem videt. Ea ❲❛eum❜❳❪600010.md❫ salutat.

▪▪▪▪ Speaker-Deixis

◦ DEU: Ich bin Michael - ❲❛Ich❜❳❪600010.md❫ arbeite.
◦ ENG: I am Michael - ❲❛I❜❳❪600010.md❫ work.
◦ LAT: Ego Michael sum - ❲❛Ego❜❳❪600010.md❫ laboro.

▪▪▪ Demonstrative-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Entity-Deixis

◦ DEU: Ich sehe einen Mann - ❲❛Dieser❜❳❪600010.md❫ arbeitet.
◦ ENG: I see a Man - ❲❛This one❜❳❪600010.md❫ works.
◦ LAT: Virum video - ❲❛Hic❜❳❪600010.md❫ laborat.

▪▪▪▪ Statement-Anaphora

◦ DEU: Michael kündigt. ❲❛Das❜❳❪600010.md❫ überrascht mich.
◦ ENG: Michael resigns. ❲❛That❜❳❪600010.md❫ surprises me.
◦ LAT: Michael munere se abdicat. ❲❛Hoc❜❳❪600010.md❫ mihi mirum est.

▪▪▪ Possessive-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Ownership

◦ DEU: Dieses Buch ist ❲❛meins❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ ENG: This Book is ❲❛mine❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ LAT: Hic Liber ❲❛meus❜❳❪600010.md❫ est.

▪▪▪ Reflexive-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Subject-Coreference

◦ DEU: Der Mann sieht ❲❛sich❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ ENG: The Man sees ❲❛himself❜❳❪600010.md❫.
◦ LAT: Vir ❲❛se❜❳❪600010.md❫ videt.

▪▪▪ Relative-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Subject-Reference

◦ DEU: Der Mann, ❲❛der❜❳❪600010.md❫ arbeitet, singt.
◦ ENG: The Man, ❲❛who❜❳❪600010.md❫ works, sings.
◦ LAT: Vir, ❲❛qui❜❳❪600010.md❫ laborat, cantat.

▪▪▪ Interrogative-Pronouns

▪▪▪▪ Unknown-Person

